   "text": "On Friday, Lola went to try out for the bowling team. Well, she tried to try out. But she couldn't even fit through the door of the bowling alley. \"You're just too tall,\" the coach shouted from inside. \"Sorry!\" Lola was sad. When she got home, she said, \"I give up. I can't be on a team. I'm just too tall.\"",
